review / review	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-08-15T04:41:34.1726456Z - I could not execute the solution (read-only), but I statically traced four representative orders (`O00_G`, `O00_K`, `O00_L`, `O00_M`) through `solve.py` against the seeded data and each reproduced the hardcoded test expectation, giving high confidence the reference solution and verifier are aligned. Running `solve.py` and diffing `report.json` against the 19 asserted tuples would fully confirm criteria 5/10/13.
